@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Index";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_UserSideLayout.cshtml";
}
<div class="container p-5" style="background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; margin-top:30px; box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h1 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Internet Assistance – Stay Connected Without the Stress</h1>
            <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
                There is no doubt that the web is a connecting platform for virtually every communication, work, or leisure activity. However, issues like connectivity gaps or even a mix-up in the apparatus may spoil your online experience. Be it finding out why Wi-Fi keeps disconnecting or how best to handle issues that come with the use of the internet, we want to ensure that you are able to link, and carry out your work, without any trouble.
            </p>
            <br />
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Common Internet Issues We Solve:</h2>
            <ul style="font-size: 18px; list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Do you have any issues with the stability or strength of your wireless Internet and its connection? The issue is in the placement of either your router or other surrounding devices.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Having issues with installing your modem or router? Don’t worry; we will guarantee that you will have the proper network configuration and the best performance out of it.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Are you feeling security concerns? Whether it’s a phishing hoax or an interior raid, keeping your virtual persona safe has reached a new level.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Are you having trouble with email retrieval or loading any web pages? You may need to change some settings in Internet options configuration.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <span style="color: #007BFF; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;">•</span> Are you confused with the data plan that you have? There are many people who have no idea what it means and how it works in the terms of the service provider.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">How TechValet Helps You:</h2>
            <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555;">
                The experts under our employment are involved in the troubleshooting of any connectivity issues, installation and maintenance of devices, and making sure that all the internet services provided are secure and safe for use.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Call to Action Section -->
<div class="cta-container" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; padding:20px">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: #333;">Relax and have fun in your virtual surroundings without any worries. Contact us for help with anything related to the internet.</h3>
    <p style="font-family: 'Myriad Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: #555;">Call TechValet Computer Support for fast and reliable service.</p>
    <a href="@Url.Action("Contact","Home")" style="background-color: #E48F01; color: #fff; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 18px; border: none; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 20px; transition: background-color 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#000'" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#E48F01'">
        Call Us Now
    </a>
</div>
